[agent] One CLI note worth flagging: `hops fg insert` from CSV doesn't coerce an ISO-8601 string column into a declared `timestamp` feature (it failed type validation), so I stored `ts` as a string and derived the date in the aggregation query. Also, Trino queries required `--no-verify` due to an IP-SAN cert mismatch on the query-service host, and the cached FG was a Delta table reachable via the `delta` catalog (not `iceberg`/`hive`).
